<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-05T11:16:51.491Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 11:16:51 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;China has warned it could cut undersea cables that connect Taiwan and the Philippines while increasing patrols near Taiwan, heightening maritime tension. The Philippine Coast Guard has investigated a Chinese survey ship carrying unidentified equipment inside Scarborough Shoal and has deployed its flagship BRP Teresa Magbanua to southeastern Mindanao for security. The Coast Guard also rescued a ferry in Quezon waters, delivered fuel to fishermen at Scarborough Shoal, and assisted more than 150,000 sea travelers during the Undas period. The conflict remains low-intensity, with 176 battle-related deaths recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQVTQzT3kxVmMtak9FMGI2bmhlVnFuUkpqUnZtWVE1SFRnaG93UVlOU3ZWQklTRDlqcTFJYTZOQXB1UnkxRHVOSDctN1ZJLTFxVElQeGtFaTRGcXJMZTQ1RGVIM2lXWWNxa3EzWTRNWS1FRWhjZ25BNUY3WnVmeFE3TEFLbi1OZzNQVEhOUFVPaDZ6ZlVaYV81NGVpUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/week-asia/politics/article/3373374/philippine-envoy-says-us-immigration-detention-rules-may-change-after-midterms&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxObnRSMjJJYlZUc1VibTlCSVdCQlJEOC1CM2R2dlZuR20tREwwYzQwRHFiYnVETGNnWlNtSk9PM3NVYmJzdHNaNzNoLVBGdkZhMEhXOEMxUS0zUkpTM0UweENKUzZoQU0xUV9MSnI4OGN6SGRaQnZyUFNhT1dMdWVnMFFyR0MwVENBR0t3OEZFOHlYMW9DT2VqNjFWS1lqRzl2Wk53ZkZHMzltYnBmZnh3RE1hVkVITmRFbTFETkI3cTRzczQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mindanao Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNQ3BJYnJXZWM3YVc5eVo4Y2xjRjNVa29lWW5KSExVTEhxY25YUk1PTFFwR3BBWVJTaF9iZUl4RXI0SnFYYlJoamUyN0c4b3Y5el9Eb0tucFZ1emwwdVdTVlYtOG1qb1RUeTBYVFUwelYteEVVM0s0YndablhkS2xIMmp1WlljN0FKalI0RURKb2xqWUNXWm5oZE5pUlJDR2d1eHQ4?oc=5&quot;&gt;New York Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a hre